Package: dataraft.metrics
Title: Metrics Components for DataRaft
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Jan-Hendrik", "Weinert", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "65009403+JanWein@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Compute reusable metrics on tables and checked product results.
    Builds on dataraft.core. Optional dataraft.lake integration freezes reports
    and reads versioned lake releases.
